00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:10,500
no, it was different before

255
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:13,240
Kamui's story has a lot in common with yours

256
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:15,740
it's been about two years now

257
00:20:15,740 --> 00:20:18,180
his arrival in Tokyo was very sudden

258
00:20:18,180 --> 00:20:20,680
he appeared in City Hall

259
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:22,300
the building we live in

260
00:20:22,300 --> 00:20:23,520
without warning

261
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:25,200
at first we were convinced

262
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,680
he'd come to steal our water

263
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:28,540
he was a bit out of it at the time

264
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:31,120
confused or disoriented somehow

265
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,040
disoriented?

266
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:34,180
I think Kazuki put it best

267
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:36,700
he said that Kamui had the look of a child

268
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:37,780
who'd lost his way

269
00:20:37,780 --> 00:20:41,740
then he looked at the water and spoke

270
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:44,340
I'm staying

271
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:46,840
I'll protect it

272
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:50,300
I'll protect it

273
00:20:50,300 --> 00:20:52,360
and so from that point on

274
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:54,980
Kamui has become a permanent part of your lives here?

275
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,040
that's right

276
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:57,940
Kakyo said something

277
00:20:57,940 --> 00:21:00,180
he thinks you and Kamui are similar

278
00:21:00,180 --> 00:21:05,360
and that you're both searching single-mindedly for something

279
00:21:05,360 --> 00:21:08,180
he's right

280
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:09,680
there's something I have to find

281
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,680
no matter what

282
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:23,680
he's waking up

283
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:40,140
she's right

284
00:21:40,140 --> 00:21:51,740
Shaoran.

285
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:55,580
Why are you here?

286
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,800
Why are you talking to me?

287
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:58,980
You've been sleeping.

288
00:21:59,580 --> 00:22:01,240
But you have to wake up now.

289
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:03,480
I can't.

290
00:22:04,220 --> 00:22:05,960
I don't know how.

291
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:09,620
Wake up.

292
00:22:10,140 --> 00:22:12,020
Someone you care about needs you.

293
00:22:19,740 --> 00:22:20,340
Hey.

294
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:22,200
Princess, wake up.

295
00:22:25,120 --> 00:22:25,940
Oh no.

296
00:22:26,540 --> 00:22:27,420
She isn't breathing.

297
00:22:28,840 --> 00:22:30,980
I sense the weather.

298
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:32,080
It's really strong.

299
00:22:32,560 --> 00:22:34,420
Can't you tell me where it's coming from, Hokunar?

300
00:22:35,100 --> 00:22:36,360
It's back there.

301
00:22:36,860 --> 00:22:38,920
Under the building where the others are.

302
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,240
Under City Hall.

303
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:48,860
Careful, Fi.

304
00:22:49,200 --> 00:22:51,780
Don't you see? Shaoran isn't after your water.

305
00:22:51,980 --> 00:22:53,920
He's looking for something Sakura needs.

306
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:54,500
Sakura.

307
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:59,220
It's something very important for someone very important to me.

308
00:23:02,660 --> 00:23:05,720
We should have realized that the seal wouldn't hold you forever.

309
00:23:07,360 --> 00:23:08,640
You're going, aren't you?

310
00:23:09,220 --> 00:23:10,400
I won't stop you.

311
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:13,560
But you don't have the power to travel through dimensions.

312
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:17,620
Lucky for you, I can help.

313
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:20,020
But I can only do this once.

314
00:23:20,020 --> 00:23:28,760
Why would you do this?

315
00:23:29,760 --> 00:23:30,860
Why, you ask?

316
00:23:31,180 --> 00:23:32,840
Because the dream must end.

317
00:23:34,840 --> 00:23:35,880
I'll find a doctor.

318
00:23:36,620 --> 00:23:38,460
If a doctor would even know what to do.

319
00:23:38,460 --> 00:23:40,420
This isn't something medicine can help.

320
00:23:41,540 --> 00:23:43,620
You came from more than a different world.

321
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:45,740
It was an entirely different dimension.

322
00:23:57,780 --> 00:23:59,100
You're here at last.

323
00:23:59,100 --> 00:24:17,200
I'll find another.

324
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:47,180
Thank you.

325
00:24:47,200 --> 00:25:17,180
Thank you.

326
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:47,180
Thank you.

327
00:25:47,200 --> 00:26:17,180
Thank you.

328
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:47,180
Thank you.

